{"id":"785c80475c01fc69","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","title":"Measure-Preserving","display":"df-measure-preserving — Measure-Preserving","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measure-preserving","aliases":["58-df-measure-preserving","Measure-Preserving"],"display":"df-measure-preserving — Measure-Preserving","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measure-preserving"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measure-preserving</span><span>Measure-Preserving</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure-preserving — Measure-Preserving"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X, \\mathcal{F}, \\mu)\">\\((X, \\mathcal{F}, \\mu)\\)</span> (measure space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:X\\to X\">\\(T:X\\to X\\)</span> (transformation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (measurable-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\)</span> (defined here; ergodic predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\\)</span> (defined here; measure-preserving predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(T;(X,\\mathcal F),(X,\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(T;(X,\\mathcal F),(X,\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle T^{-1}[A])=0\\to(\\mu(A)=0\\lor\\mu(X\\setminus A)=0)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle T^{-1}[A])=0\\to(\\mu(A)=0\\lor\\mu(X\\setminus A)=0)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Measure-preserving: invariance of measure under transformation</li>\n<li>Ergodicity uses invariance modulo null sets, rather than literal equality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=T^{-1}[A]\">\\(A=T^{-1}[A]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Mixing: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(T^{-n}A \\cap B) \\to \\mu(A)\\mu(B)\">\\(\\mu(T^{-n}A \\cap B) \\to \\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Poincaré recurrence: points return infinitely often</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Einsiedler and Ward, Ergodic Theory with a View Towards Number Theory</li>\n<li>Petersen, Ergodic Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ (measure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (measurable-function predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X, \\mathcal{F}, \\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"T:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(T;(X,\\mathcal F),(X,\\mathcal F))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle T^{-1}[A])=0\\to(\\mu(A)=0\\lor\\mu(X\\setminus A)=0)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A=T^{-1}[A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(T^{-n}A \\cap B) \\to \\mu(A)\\mu(B)","display":false}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[{"id":"3e305602e1a0f243","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T:X\\to X$ 且 $\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)$（see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]）"},{"id":"e50d5390cadb5dd8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])"},{"id":"3f4d93e116ec636a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S$ (保测度谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])"},{"id":"4a3373ca17fc93e6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S$ (保测度谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])"},{"id":"b22a6e1e78d533a6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S$ (保测度谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])"},{"id":"a9b8c5e3158341a3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S$ (measure-preserving predicate, see [[58-df-measure-preserving]])"},{"id":"11a66aa01f6e941d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (ergodic predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])"},{"id":"5b66d1b59b418b03","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-835","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md|58-df-measure-preserving]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}